@startwbs
' SmartExam Work Breakdown Structure (Chapter-3-3, fig:wbs), down to module work packages.
' Numbering: 1-4 = phases; 2.x = sprint groups (Sprints 2-7, tab:timeframe in Chapter-2-2);
' 2.x.y = one module each. Every module package includes its own tests (definition of done,
' Chapter-3-3), so package 3 holds only the final integration and full regression of Sprint 8.
' Legibility: labels are wrapped to keep the PNG about 1250 px wide, so 13 pt text prints
' at about 7 pt at \linewidth.
' Render: java -jar plantuml.jar -tpng work_breakdown_structure.puml
skinparam dpi 150
<style>
wbsDiagram {
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 13
  BackgroundColor white
  LineColor #555555
  node {
    BackgroundColor white
    LineColor #555555
    RoundCorner 4
    Padding 4
  }
  :depth(0) {
    BackgroundColor #B03A2E
    FontColor white
    FontStyle bold
    FontSize 14
    LineColor #B03A2E
  }
  :depth(1) {
    BackgroundColor #D9D9D9
    FontStyle bold
  }
  :depth(2) {
    BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  }
}
</style>
* SmartExam
** 1 Planning and\nRequirements\n(Sprint 1)
*** 1.1 Requirements\nand use cases
*** 1.2 Product\nbacklog
*** 1.3 Architecture
*** 1.4 Scope\napproval
** 2 Module Development\n(Sprints 2-7; each\nmodule with its tests)
*** <b>2.1 Access, identity</b>\n(Sprint 2)
**** 2.1.1 M1\nAuthentication and\ndevice binding
**** 2.1.2 M7 User and\nrole management
*** <b>2.2 Exam set-up</b>\n(Sprint 3)
**** 2.2.1 M8 Exam\ncreation and\nconfiguration
**** 2.2.2 M9 Eligibility\nand access control
*** <b>2.3 Student client</b>\n(Sprint 4)
**** 2.3.1 M2 Readiness\ncheck, practice exam
**** 2.3.2 M3 Student\nexam dashboard
**** 2.3.3 M4 Secure\nexam environment
*** <b>2.4 Monitoring</b>\n(Sprint 5)
**** 2.4.1 M5 Live\nmonitoring client
**** 2.4.2 M10 Live\nproctoring dashboard
*** <b>2.5 Submission,</b>\n<b>evaluation</b> (Sprint 6)
**** 2.5.1 M6 Submission\nand backup
**** 2.5.2 M11\nAI-assisted\nevaluation
*** <b>2.6 Logs, reporting</b>\n(Sprint 7)
**** 2.6.1 M12 Logs,\nanalytics, audit trail
** 3 Integration and\nSystem Testing\n(Sprint 8)
*** 3.1 Final integration\nof M1-M12
*** 3.2 End-to-end\nsystem tests
*** 3.3 Full regression\n(xUnit, Playwright)
*** 3.4 Bug fixing
** 4 Documentation\nand Delivery\n(all sprints)
*** 4.1 Sprint\nreviews
*** 4.2 FYP-I\nreport
*** 4.3 Final\nthesis
*** 4.4 Final\ndemo
@endwbs
